    {
      "id": "claim_2b67dd35bb6b45ccbf03bd62461c8ccd",
      "statement": "Deterministic filename encryption uses a Synthetic IV (SIV) construction combining a Blake2b-512 PRF (domain-separated OIFS_SIV_FILENAME_V2_XCHACHA20) tweaked with the parent inode ID and filename_siv_key, XChaCha20-Poly1305 authenticated encryption with filename_cipher_key and parent_inode bound in AEAD AAD, SIV verification by re-computing the nonce from decrypted plaintext, and unpadded Base64URL formatting with an '_e_' prefix. Legacy 12-byte ChaCha20Poly1305 format (OIFS_SIV_FILENAME_V1) is supported as a fallback.",
