    {
      "id": "claim_0a3b7192aaf645cebbbf0f7c608fae04",
      "statement": "SuperBlock::encryption_version records the encryption scheme: 0 = unencrypted (ignored), 1 = ENCRYPTION_SCHEME_LEGACY (empty AAD), 2 = ENCRYPTION_SCHEME_CONTEXT_BOUND (structured AAD binding inode_id/chunk_idx/flags). New encrypted images always write version 2. Validation rejects unencrypted images with non-zero version, and encrypted images with unknown version. The AAD helpers return empty AAD for scheme < 2, preserving legacy read compatibility.",
